# Auth — main endpoints. Generated skeleton, synthetic data only.
# Variables: see rest/http-client.env.json (host, session, xsrf). How to get them: docs/guides/api.md
# Full list of Auth operations: /api/docs (tag "Auth").

### GET /api/auth/me — auth.me
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}

### PATCH /api/auth/me/locale — auth.me.locale
PATCH {{host}}/api/auth/me/locale
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "locale": "uk"
}

### POST /api/auth/logout — auth.logout
POST {{host}}/api/auth/logout
Accept: application/json
Cookie: {{session_cookie_name}}={{session}}; XSRF-TOKEN={{xsrf}}
X-XSRF-TOKEN: {{xsrf}}
Referer: {{host}}/

